# Values for integrations/portrait-spec/lead.md in this package (sync.sh).
# One plain Agent Skills folder for tools that take skills but no plugins:
# Amp (amp skill add), Warp and Zed (~/.agents/skills/portrait). SKILL.md
# routes to the rendered steps in steps/; scripts/ lives in the skill folder.
# The portrait's own model runs use Claude Code, Codex or Gemini CLI.
LEAD=this agent
LEAD_ID=agent
RUNNER=auto
SCRIPT="<skill-dir>/scripts/portrait-agents"
PORTRAIT_COMMAND=the portrait skill's build step
AS_ME_COMMAND=the portrait skill's do step:
FIDELITY_COMMAND=the portrait skill's fidelity step
PUBLISH_COMMAND=the portrait skill's publish step
JOBS_COMMAND=the portrait skill's jobs step
COMMANDS_DIR=integrations/agent-skill/portrait/steps
COMMANDS_FORMAT=md
